      "writtenOn": "2024-06-28T16:25:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Primary goal of restricted mode handling in the stack is that the devices added by the guest should not get access to the system in the normal user mode.\n\nProblem specifically reported in b/346337854 is that guests lose their bonded device if BT restarts for any reason (including crashes).\n\nConcern raised in this comment essentially means that BT stack should be able to differentiate between different guest mode instances. Without the ability to distinguish between guest mode instances, it would be in contradiction to the issue reported in b/346337854.\n\nI would prefer to solve the reported problem than the concern raised in this comment. You can raise a separate bug for that if you wish so.",
      "parentUuid": "6c017eb8_7afa9d17",
      "revId": "78f203a51f13392c9fd3b468877e6a5233431cc6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "bbbe0165_3c339c33",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1881060
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-06-28T17:21:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "From a privacy / security point of view, this patch is creating a regression by leaking the paired device to any other guest users.\n\nI believe that different guests users have different identifier in Android. Therefor it should already be possible to distinguish between the user.\n\nThis CL is introducing the bug I am describing. I think we need to address the issue.\n\n---\n\nUsing a proper storage within the user app data would automatically solve the issue and this should be the way forward, but I understand that the CL to do that require a bit (a lot) more work.\n\nA \"quick and dirty\" workaround would be to save the current user id in the database. Then when you purge you check if it is the same guest user or not.",
      "parentUuid": "532ed233_51721b1c",
      "revId": "78f203a51f13392c9fd3b468877e6a5233431cc6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
